<%- include('header') %><section class="workspace"><a class="back" href="/dashboard">← My prompts</a><div class="heading-row"><div><p class="eyebrow">PLAN YOUR MONETIZATION</p><h1>What could your page earn?</h1></div><span class="pill">ESTIMATE ONLY</span></div><p class="lead compact">Explore the numbers before enabling ads. These are editable assumptions, not measured traffic, an earnings balance or a payout promise.</p><div class="calculator-grid"><form class="card stack" id="earnings-form"><h2>Your assumptions</h2><label>Monthly page views<input name="pageViews" type="number" value="10000" min="0" max="1000000000" step="1" required></label><div class="form-grid"><label>Ad slots per page<input name="slots" type="number" value="1" min="0" max="4" step="1" required></label><label>Ad fill rate (%)<input name="fillRate" type="number" value="70" min="0" max="100" step="1" required></label></div><label>Ad revenue per 1,000 filled impressions (USD)<input name="ecpm" type="number" value="1" min="0" max="1000" step="0.01" required><small>Use the ad network’s publisher eCPM. $1 is an example, not a market forecast.</small></label><label>Creator share (%)<input name="creatorShare" type="number" value="50" min="0" max="100" step="1" required><small>50% is the proposed split. The final policy has not been set.</small></label><button class="button" type="submit">Calculate estimate</button></form><section class="card estimate" aria-live="polite"><p class="eyebrow">ILLUSTRATIVE MONTHLY ESTIMATE</p><h2>Creator’s share</h2><output id="creator-earning">$3.50</output><div class="estimate-row"><span>Filled ad impressions</span><strong id="impressions">7,000</strong></div><div class="estimate-row"><span>Total ad revenue</span><strong id="total-earning">$7.00</strong></div><div class="estimate-row"><span>Platform share, before costs</span><strong id="platform-earning">$3.50</strong></div><p class="formula">Page views × slots × fill rate ÷ 1,000 × publisher eCPM</p><p class="muted">Excludes hosting costs, taxes, payout fees and ad-network adjustments. Platform share is not profit. Actual payouts require settled, creator-attributed revenue.</p><p class="alert" id="calculator-error" hidden></p></section></div></section><%- include('footer') %>
